{% block agentic_agents_md %}{% apply remove_leading_spaces %}
    {% block agentic_agents_header %}
        # Agent instructions for {{ channel.translated.name|default(channel.name) }}
    {% endblock %}

    {% block agentic_agents_summary %}
        This file describes how AI agents and assistants should interact with this public Contena channel.
        These instructions apply to public resources for this channel and do not replace policies published elsewhere.
    {% endblock %}

    {% block agentic_agents_principles %}
        ## General principles

        - Act only on behalf of a user and follow the user's explicit intent.
        - Use public channel content as the source of truth.
        - Respect `robots.txt`, published access rules, rate limits, and applicable laws.
        - Do not treat this file as permission to bypass authentication, account, or security controls.
    {% endblock %}

    {% block agentic_agents_content %}
        ## Content interactions

        - You may help users discover articles, compare publicly available information, and navigate to relevant pages.
        - Verify current content on the live channel before presenting it as authoritative.
        - Do not create accounts, submit forms, or change member data without explicit user confirmation.
        - Authentication, consent, and legally relevant confirmations must happen through the channel or another approved flow.
    {% endblock %}

    {% block agentic_agents_data %}
        ## Data handling

        - Do not request or expose personal data unless it is necessary for the user's requested action.
        - Do not infer private member information from unavailable sources.
        - Do not present generated text as an official policy unless it is published by the channel owner.
    {% endblock %}

    {% block agentic_agents_extensions %}{% endblock %}

    {% block user_provided_content %}{% endblock %}
{% endapply %}{% endblock %}
